  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFID Support to the National AIDS Council - HIV Common Fund 2009 -2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To prevent HIV transmission through expanded service provision and effective behaviour change communication through supporting the successful implementation of the Government of Mozambique&apos;s HIV/AIDS multisectoral plan (PEN II &amp;III) and thus help deliver the HIV related goals enshrined in the governments&apos;s Poverty Reduction Strategy and the MDGs. The aim of this support is to allow DFID to maintain a strategic role on AIDS, through ongoing engagement in the national policy dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
